// Modifications:
// - `isize` → `i32`.
// - Closures `|x| x + 1` lowered to named fn-ptrs (closure-as-fn-ptr
//   at method-arg site is partial in Logos).
// - `Ok::<isize, isize>(1)` turbofish → bare `Ok(1i32)` with a typed
